WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.150
Standing medium punch opens the close confirm.

2
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:01.650
Crouching medium punch precedes the OD kick.

3
00:00:01.650 --> 00:00:02.700
OD Donkey Kick launches Ken away.

4
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:03.650
Ryu waits before catching the falling opponent with forward heavy kick.

5
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:04.150
Airborne Tatsu continues the carry.

6
00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:04.300
Ken lands after the airborne follow-up.
